    "en": {
      "trackName": "Atomic Containment",
      "description": "Take control of the arena and contain the chaotic atoms before time runs out. Switch the axis between horizontal and vertical to draw walls and enclose sections of the grid. Every line you carve helps trap the atoms—but one wrong move can cost you a life. Stay sharp, watch their movement, and don’t let any atom touch you while you’re creating walls.\n\nTo advance, you must capture 60% or more of the arena. The pressure builds as the timer counts down, forcing quick thinking and precise movement. Each completed level introduces more atoms, faster patterns, and less room for mistakes.\n\nAs levels increase, the arena becomes more crowded and unpredictable. Adapt your strategy, predict the atoms’ paths, and carve out the space you need to survive. How far can you go as the challenge intensifies and every decision matters?\n\nMaster the timing. Enclose the space. Contain the chaos.",
